preConditionHook:
// EL: close >= open long, close <= open short. Brooks's stated MINIMUM for a
// follow-through bar to confirm an always-in flip -- the bar must not close
// AGAINST the direction, which is a double negative, not 'must close with it'.
// The NON-STRICT comparison is the whole content: a doji with close = open
// passes both sides here, where ConsecutiveUpBars(1) and
// SignalBarBodyMatchesTradeDirection(lag = 0) both fail it. So this is not
// either of those at a parameter setting.
// el_ge/el_le carry EL's measured 2.22e-12 absolute relational tolerance, which
// is what decides the tie in the twin as well.
